<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορ-εύσιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Them.
			<u>Or.</u>
			6.83c
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that may be
				crossed, passable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ ποταμοῦ ὁδὸς π. ἀνθρώποις
					ἐγίγνετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.5.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ π. εἴη τὸ ἔδαφος τοῦ
				ποταμοῦ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἦν τὸ . . πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					24e
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύραι] ἀνθρώποις π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Antr.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεχέτωσαν . . π. τὰς ὁδούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					483.30
				</span></i>
			 (Pergam.): in neut., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ὁδόν], ἥνπερ
				ἥν πορεύσιμον</span> by which it was <i>possible to pass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				1046
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>able to go</i> or <i>travel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Epin.</u>
				981d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>able to carry,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὄχημα τοῖς κομιζομένοις,</span> of
			the sea, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.86e
			</span></i>.</div>
